.html" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="2026-09-17" /><published>2026-09-17T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-09-17T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://morsecodepodcast.github.io/2026/09/17/Post</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://morsecodepodcast.github.io/2026/09/17/Post.html"><![CDATA[<p>Q:What is the sound of one cat napping?A:Mu.</p>]]></content><author><name></name></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Q:What is the sound of one cat napping?A:Mu.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">2026-09-16</title><link href="https://morsecodepodcast.github.io/2026/09/16/Post.html" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="2026-09-16" /><published>2026-09-16T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-09-16T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://morsecodepodcast.github.io/2026/09/16/Post</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://morsecodepodcast.github.io/2026/09/16/Post.html"><![CDATA[<p>Q:How do you stop an elephant from charging?A:Take away his credit cards.</p>]]></content><author><name></name></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Q:How do you stop an elephant from charging?A:Take away his credit cards.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">2026-09-15</title><link href="https://morsecodepodcast.github.io/2026/09/15/Post.html" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="2026-09-15" /><published>2026-09-15T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-09-15T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://morsecodepodcast.github.io/2026/09/15/Post</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://morsecodepodcast.github.io/2026/09/15/Post.html"><![CDATA[<p>Beware of a dark-haired man with a loud tie.</p>]]></content><author><name></name></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Beware of a dark-haired man with a loud tie.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">2026-09-14</title><link href="https://morsecodepodcast.github.io/2026/09/14/Post.html" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="2026-09-14" /><published>2026-09-14T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-09-14T0